---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Personal Data Processing Policy | Kαiros" description="Kαiros personal data processing policy, in compliance with Colombian Law 1581 of 2012 and Decree 1377 of 2013.">
	<Header />
	<main class="legal section-padding">
		<div class="legal-inner">
			<h1>Personal Data Processing Policy</h1>
			<p class="legal-meta">Last updated: August 23, 2026</p>

			<p>At Kαiros, we take the protection of your personal information seriously. This policy describes how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal data, in compliance with Colombian <strong>Statutory Law 1581 of 2012</strong>, <strong>Decree 1377 of 2013</strong>, and all other applicable regulations on personal data protection in the Republic of Colombia.</p>

			<h2>1. Data controller</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Name:</strong> Kαiros</li>
				<li><strong>Email:</strong> weare@comkairos.com</li>
				<li><strong>Phone:</strong> +57 313 302 4941</li>
				<li><strong>Location:</strong> Colombia</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Kαiros acts as the data controller for personal data collected through this website, email, WhatsApp, and scheduling platforms.</p>

			<h2>2. Personal data we collect</h2>
			<p>Depending on how you interact with us, we may collect the following data:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Identification data:</strong> full name.</li>
				<li><strong>Contact data:</strong> email address, phone number.</li>
				<li><strong>Browsing data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited, time spent (collected automatically through cookies or analytics tools).</li>
				<li><strong>Voluntarily provided data:</strong> any information you share with us through forms, email, WhatsApp, or during our conversations and meetings.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Kαiros does <strong>not</strong> collect sensitive data (racial or ethnic origin, political orientation, religious beliefs, health data, sexual orientation, biometric data) unless you voluntarily provide it in the context of our engagement, in which case it will be treated with the highest standards of confidentiality.</p>

			<h2>3. Purposes of data processing</h2>
			<p>Your personal data will be processed for the following purposes:</p>
			<ol>
				<li>Responding to your inquiries and information requests.</li>
				<li>Scheduling and managing conversations, meetings, and engagements.</li>
				<li>Providing the coaching, strategy, and digital development services you have contracted.</li>
				<li>Sending relevant information about our services, content, or updates (only with your prior consent).</li>
				<li>Improving the browsing experience on our website.</li>
				<li>Fulfilling legal, accounting, or tax obligations.</li>
			</ol>

			<h2>4. Legal basis for processing</h2>
			<p>The processing of your data is based on:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Your consent:</strong> by providing your data through forms, email, WhatsApp, or by scheduling a conversation, you authorize us to process them in accordance with this policy.</li>
				<li><strong>Performance of a contract or service relationship:</strong> when necessary to provide the services you have requested.</li>
				<li><strong>Legal obligation:</strong> when the law requires us to retain or report certain information.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>5. Data subject rights</h2>
			<p>As a data subject, you have the right to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Access:</strong> view the personal data we hold about you in our databases.</li>
				<li><strong>Update:</strong> request correction of inaccurate, incomplete, or outdated data.</li>
				<li><strong>Rectify:</strong> correct information that is imprecise.</li>
				<li><strong>Request proof of authorization:</strong> obtain evidence that you granted consent for the processing.</li>
				<li><strong>Revoke authorization:</strong> withdraw your consent for data processing, provided no legal or contractual obligation prevents it.</li>
				<li><strong>Delete:</strong> request the deletion of your data when you believe they are not being processed in accordance with the law or this policy.</li>
				<li><strong>File complaints:</strong> with the Superintendence of Industry and Commerce (SIC) for violations of personal data regulations.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>To exercise any of these rights, you may write to us at <strong>weare@comkairos.com</strong>, stating your full name, the right you wish to exercise, and a brief description of your request. We will respond within a maximum of <strong>ten (10) business days</strong> from receipt of your request. If the request is incomplete, we will contact you within five (5) business days to complete it.</p>

			<h2>6. Data transfer and transmission</h2>
			<p>To provide our services, your data may be processed by the following third-party platforms:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Cal.com:</strong> for scheduling conversations. Their servers may be located outside Colombia.</li>
				<li><strong>WhatsApp (Meta Platforms):</strong> for direct communication. Subject to Meta's privacy policy.</li>
				<li><strong>Email service provider:</strong> for email communication.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>In all cases, these platforms have adequate data protection policies and security levels. The transfer is carried out under your consent and in compliance with Article 26 of Law 1581 of 2012.</p>

			<h2>7. Information security</h2>
			<p>Kαiros adopts reasonable technical, human, and administrative measures to protect your personal data against unauthorized access, loss, alteration, or improper disclosure. These measures include:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Restricted access to data only by authorized personnel.</li>
				<li>Use of encrypted connections (HTTPS) on our website.</li>
				<li>Periodic review of security measures adopted.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>8. Cookies</h2>
			<p>Our website may use first-party and third-party cookies to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Ensure the technical functioning of the site.</li>
				<li>Analyze browsing behavior in an aggregated and anonymous manner.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>You can configure your browser to reject cookies or to alert you when a site attempts to install them. Please note that disabling cookies may affect site functionality.</p>

			<h2>9. Data retention</h2>
			<p>We will retain your personal data for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this policy, and while a service relationship or legal obligation justifies it. Once your data is no longer needed, it will be securely deleted from our databases.</p>

			<h2>10. Minors</h2>
			<p>Our services are intended for individuals over the age of 18. We do not intentionally collect personal data from minors under 18 years of age. If we discover that we have received data from a minor without the consent of their legal representative, we will delete it immediately.</p>

			<h2>11. Changes to this policy</h2>
			<p>Kαiros reserves the right to update this policy at any time. Any changes will be published on this page with the date of the last update. We recommend reviewing this policy periodically.</p>

			<h2>12. Data protection authority</h2>
			<p>If you believe your rights have not been adequately addressed, you may file a complaint with the <strong>Superintendence of Industry and Commerce (SIC)</strong> of Colombia:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Website:</strong> www.sic.gov.co</li>
				<li><strong>Toll-free national line:</strong> 01 8000 910 165</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>13. Contact</h2>
			<p>For any inquiry, request, or complaint related to the processing of your personal data, you may contact us at:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Email:</strong> weare@comkairos.com</li>
				<li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +57 313 302 4941</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
	.legal {
		background-color: var(--color-light);
		min-height: 60vh;
	}
	.legal-inner {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.legal-inner h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
		color: var(--color-dark);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.legal-meta {
		color: var(--color-gray);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}
	.legal-inner h2 {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		color: var(--color-dark);
		margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
	}
	.legal-inner p {
		color: var(--color-gray);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
	.legal-inner ul,
	.legal-inner ol {
		color: var(--color-gray);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}
	.legal-inner li {
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}
	.legal-inner strong {
		color: var(--color-dark);
	}
</style>
